<title>THAILAND: RESEARCH ALERT - Buy PERFEC - Asia Equity.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Buy PERFEC - Asia Equity.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research house Asia Equity said on Tuesday it had rated Thailand's Property Pefect a buy because it had started successfully selling part of its projects as sub-divided land plots instead of land with built-up houses.</p>
<p>&quot;We think it is a good strategy,&quot; the firm said in a new report. &quot;We remain a buyer of the stock.&quot;</p>
</text>
